{"title": "#UNDANGAN PERNIKAHAN", "url": "https://bali.antaranews.com/tag/undangan-pernikahan/2"}, {"title": "Persepsi Calon Pengantin Terhadap Layanan Bimbingan Perkawinan di Kantor Urusan Agama Kecamatan Tanjung Selor", "url": "https://repository.uinsi.ac.id/handle/123456789/4199"}]}, "The search didn't turn up anything on \"Bimbang Bebalai\" specifically. It returned a few related sources on Serawai marriage customs:\n\n- **Cincin Penyembah tradition:** A 2023 study in the journal AHKAM examines a Serawai wedding custom in Central Bengkulu, where a ring is given as a way of protecting young women's virginity. The authors frame it as part of the tribe's social bonding and as consistent with Islamic legal objectives. (journal.uinjkt.ac.id)\n- **Changes to customary marriage:** A 2025 paper from Talang Beringin village finds that Serawai customary marriage has changed mainly after the engagement stage. Older terms and practices such as \"ngantar sirih pinang\" and \"cara malim\" are mentioned, and the author attributes the shift to modernization and declining interest among younger people. (jurnal.unived.ac.id)\n- **Sebambangan:** A journal article on Buay Pematang Ribu Ranau, a related South Sumatran community, describes elopement-style marriage as an option when couples face parental opposition. It doesn't mention Bimbang Bebalai. (journal.unigha.ac.id)\n\nIf \"Bimbang Bebalai\" is a specific local term, it may be spelled differently in sources, or it may appear only in local-language or offline materials. Searching in Indonesian with alternative spellings, or for \"adat Serawai\" with \"bimbang,\" might help."], "durationSeconds": 5.788440916000002, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_013RJYncxD5qU4YDayc4gPoG", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
