{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgEQp7Z2RsJFrVuHP3nds", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "**答案：** Bimbang Bebalai 是**婚礼仪式**（传统婚礼庆典），来自**塞拉瓦伊族（Suku Serawai）**，流行于印尼明古鲁省南部，包括 Bengkulu Selatan 和 Seluma 一带。\n\n搜索结果里的要点：\n- 婚礼在村民合力搭起的会堂（balai）里举行，所以叫 \"bebalai\"。结婚契约（akad nikah）在新娘家办。\n- 通常 3 到 5 对新人一起办，按习俗要宰一头水牛。\n- 2020 年发表在 Handep 期刊上的论文说，撑起这个仪式的传统机构已经不起作用了，所以现在这个仪式办不起来了。\n\n我只看了搜索结果给的摘要，没有点开原文核对。\n\n**依据：**\n- [TRADISI BIMBANG BEBALAI PADA ETNIS SERAWAI（Handep 期刊）](https://handep.kemdikbud.go.id/index.php/handep/article/view/131)\n- [Bimbang Bebalai – Budaya Indonesia](https://budaya-indonesia.org/bimbang-bebalai)\n- [Bimbang Bebalai – Wikipedia bahasa Indonesia](https://id.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bimbang_Bebalai)\n\n共搜了 3 次。"}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 1783, "cache_read_input_tokens": 6861, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 1783}, "output_tokens": 3, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-21T00:09:58.215Z", "request_id": "req_011CgEQp7Gfh2fzEbZVXQgND"}
